<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>vaemptîness</title>
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    body {
      background: #ffffff;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      min-height: 100vh;
      padding: 2rem;
      font-family: Georgia, serif;
      font-size: clamp(1.0625rem, 3.6vw, 1.25rem);
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #111111;
    }

    main {
      max-width: 40rem;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .verse {
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    /* Below this width the four verse lines wrap anyway, and a wrap is
       indistinguishable from a real line break. Let it read as prose instead. */
    @media (max-width: 42rem) {
      .verse br { display: none; }
    }

    .source {
      margin-top: 2.5rem;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      color: #666666;
    }

    /* Underlined by default, not only on hover: touch devices have no hover,
       so the affordance has to be visible at rest. */
    .source a {
      color: inherit;
      text-decoration: underline;
      text-decoration-color: #bbbbbb;
      text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
      text-underline-offset: 0.3em;
      transition: color 0.2s ease, text-decoration-color 0.2s ease;
    }

    .source a:hover {
      color: #111111;
      text-decoration-color: #111111;
    }

    .source a:focus-visible {
      outline: 2px solid #111111;
      outline-offset: 4px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main>
    <p class="verse">
      De la generosidad surge la riqueza; de la disciplina, la felicidad;<br>
      de la paciencia, la belleza; del esfuerzo, el esplendor;<br>
      de la concentración, la paz; de la sabiduría, la liberación;<br>
      de la compasión se realizan todos los fines.
    </p>
    <p class="source"><a href="{{ '/ratnavali/' | url }}">Nāgārjuna, <em>Ratnāvalī</em>, V.38</a></p>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
